  "solution": "By Vieta’s formulas for  \n\\[\nx^3-20x^2+18x-7=0\n\\]\nwith roots \\(r,s,t\\):\n\n\\[\nr+s+t=20\n\\]\n\\[\nrs+rt+st=18\n\\]\n\\[\nrst=7\n\\]\n\nNow expand:\n\\[\n(1+r)(1+s)(1+t)\n=1+(r+s+t)+(rs+rt+st)+rst\n\\]\n\nSubstitute the values:\n\\[\n=1+20+18+7=46\n\\]\n\nThe answer is 46.",
